[gd_scene load_steps=6 format=3]

; SQUAD AUTOMATIC on an AI mount. Model instanced unscaled and the muzzle hung
; off it at the model's own muzzle, the same way ai-wep_bolt.tscn does — the
; weapon mount on the frame carries the scale.
;
; 145 sustained DPS against the Ancient Rifle's 86, paid for with the worst
; accuracy in the game (22 mrad), 85m of reach, and a seven-second reload. It
; holds a lane; it does not win a duel.

